---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout 
  title="Privacy Policy | Kim Baillie"
  description="Privacy policy and data protection practices for kimbaillie.com."
>
  <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
    <a href="/">Home</a>
    <span class="separator">&rsaquo;</span>
    <span aria-current="page">Privacy Policy</span>
  </nav>

  <article class="content-box">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      At kimbaillie.com, accessible from https://kimbaillie.com and https://www.kimbaillie.com, your privacy is respected and protected.
    </p>

    <h2>Personal Information</h2>
    <p>
      We do not collect personal information, require user registration, or operate user accounts on this website. You can explore all resources and outbound links without identifying yourself. If you contact Kim Baillie directly via email, your correspondence is used strictly to answer your inquiry and is never sold, rented, or shared with third parties.
    </p>

    <h2>Server Logs & Hosting Security</h2>
    <p>
      This website is delivered statically across Cloudflare's global content delivery network. Standard technical connection metadata (such as IP address, browser type, and access timestamp) may be automatically logged for security monitoring, DDoS prevention, and edge caching purposes.
    </p>

    <h2>External Links</h2>
    <p>
      This site serves as a portal connecting to other web properties owned or co-hosted by Kim Baillie (such as Talking in Public, Inside Exec, Floral Art Online, and Book Repair). Once you navigate to external websites, their respective privacy notices and terms apply.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
